  <ferc:NameOfOfficerWithCustodyOfCorporateBooks id="f-1" contextRef="c-1">Paul Marconi, President, Treasurer &amp; Secretary, Director</ferc:NameOfOfficerWithCustodyOfCorporateBooks>
  <ferc:AddressOfPrincipalOfficeAtEndOfPeriod id="f-2" contextRef="c-1">630 E. Foothill Blvd., San Dimas, CA 91773</ferc:AddressOfPrincipalOfficeAtEndOfPeriod>
  <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered id="f-3" contextRef="c-1">Bear Valley Electric Service, Inc. ("BVES") distributes electricity in several San Bernardino County mountain communities in California.</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered>
