        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">Bear Valley Electric Service, Inc (BVESI) has 2 long-term firm point-to-point transmission contracts with Southern California Edision (SCE). A 33kV contract from 2 points of receipt to BVES with a total capacity of 39 MW and a 115kV firm point-to-point contract from Victor to Cottonwood substation with no maximum capacity specified.</span>
